OL,3,AFrom #250 job to #9,000 bill: Inside
OL,4,Athe rogue trader networks scamming
OL,5,Acustomers at scale
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe investigation found the 23-year-old
OL,8,Fis a key figure within an organised
OL,9,Fgroup that is systematically ripping
OL,10,Foff customers and teaching others to do
OL,11,Fthe same.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
