OL,3,ANew Zealand's ruling coalition falls
OL,4,Ashort of parliamentary majority by one
OL,5,Aseat
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew Zealand's ruling coalition has
OL,8,Ffallen short of a parliamentary
OL,9,Fmajority by one seat, following a
OL,10,Fcampaign shaped by a sluggish economy
OL,11,Fand disillusioned voters.
OL,13,FIt now needs the support of the
OL,14,Fcentrist Opportunity Party to remain in
OL,15,Fpower. If they cannot reach a deal, the
OL,16,Fcountry may have to go back to the
OL,17,Fpolls.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
